  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b7f5be794788a86acd2c2c7c7a97c1347686e1ce807c6c29a7f28dcde0668976.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **3 and 5**\n\n→ 8 + 7 × **3 ÷ 14** - 5 = 6\n\n→ 8 + **7 × 3/14** - 5 = 6\n\n→ **8 + 1.5** - 5 = 6\n\n→ 9.5 - 5 = 6\n\n→ 4.5 ≠ 6\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **14 and 6**\n\n→ 8 + 7 × **5 ÷ 6** - 3 = 14\n\n→ 8 + **7 × 5/6** - 3 = 14\n\n→ **8 + 35/6** - 3 = 14\n\n→ 83/6 - 3 ≠ 14\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **8 and 5**\n\n→ 5 + 7 × **8 ÷ 14** - 3 = 6\n\n→ 5 + **7 × 8/14** - 3 = 6\n\n→ **5 + 4** - 3 = 6\n\n→ 9 - 3 = 6\n\n→ **LHS = RHS**\n\n4) **8 and 7**\n\n→ 7 + 8 × **5 ÷ 14** - 3 = 6\n\n→ 7 + **8**** × 5/14** - 3 = 6\n\n→ **7 + 20/7** - 3 = 6\n\n→ 69/7 - 3 ≠ 6\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 3 justifies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****8 and 5\"**.",
